<p>To place an order or check stock, call <a href="tel:08034883603">0803 488 3603</a> or <a href="tel:08140764150">0814 076 4150</a>, email <a href="mailto:info@xpelbeauty.com">info@xpelbeauty.com</a>, or send a trade enquiry through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. You can also visit us at Zeal Plaza, Trade Fair International Market, Lagos.</p>', 'Black Friday promo prices on 22 XBC skincare and XHC hair care lines, 1 to 30 November 2026. Full carton and unit price list, with discounts up to 28%.', 'Xpel Beauty NG', 'Promotions', '/banner/black-friday-2026.jpg', 1 FROM blog_posts b
